---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const features=[
 ['✦','Guilds','Give your people a corner of the server that feels like theirs.','docs/guilds.html'],
 ['◈','Economy & progression','A shared economy, personal rewards and reasons to keep going.','docs/economy.html'],
 ['⌁','Fishing','Cast a line, find something rare and fill out your Fishdex.','docs/fishing.html'],
 ['♫','Music','Put something on and let the voice channel do its thing.','docs/music.html'],
 ['❖','Text games','A little competition, collecting and chaos between conversations.','docs/owo.html'],
 ['⌘','Commands','The full list, without having to guess what to type.','docs/commands.html']
];
---
<SiteLayout title="NightGuildBot — Give the chat something to do" description="Guilds, fishing, progression, music and little reasons to hang around.">
<section class="container hero">
 <div class="hero-copy">
  <span class="eyebrow">A DISCORD BOT BUILT FOR THE IN-BETWEEN</span>
  <h1>Give the chat<br/><span class="gradient">something to do.</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">Start a guild. Go fishing. Get ridiculously invested in a collection. NightGuildBot brings the little side quests, shared goals and useful tools that make a server feel lived in.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="docs/getting-started.html">Take a look <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button" href="docs/index.html">Read the docs</a></div>
  <div class="hero-meta"><span><i class="status-dot"></i> Independently built</span><span>Guilds</span><span>Fishing</span><span>Games</span></div>
 </div>
 <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="NightGuildBot feature overview">
  <span class="hero-float one"><span class="float-mark">✳</span> Your server, with side quests</span>
  <div class="hero-panel">
   <div class="hero-panel-top"><span>THE NIGHT SHIFT</span><span class="panel-index">NG / 001</span></div><div class="panel-rule"></div>
   <img class="hero-emblem" src="/assets/nightguildbot-logo.webp" alt="NightGuildBot logo"/>
   <h3>NightGuild<span class="gradient">Bot</span></h3><p>There's always something going on.</p>
   <div class="hero-tags"><span><b>01</b> Guilds</span><span><b>02</b> Progression</span><span><b>03</b> Fishing</span><span><b>04</b> Music & games</span></div>
   <div class="panel-foot"><span>MADE FOR COMMUNITIES</span><span>EST. IN THE CHAT <span class="tiny-star">✦</span></span></div>
  </div>
  <span class="hero-float two">One more round? <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
 </div>
</section>
<div class="ticker" aria-label="NightGuildBot features"><div class="ticker-track"><span>GUILD UP</span><i>✳</i><span>CAST A LINE</span><i>✳</i><span>FIND YOUR NEXT FAVOURITE</span><i>✳</i><span>PLAY ANOTHER ROUND</span><i>✳</i><span>GUILD UP</span><i>✳</i><span>CAST A LINE</span><i>✳</i><span>FIND YOUR NEXT FAVOURITE</span><i>✳</i><span>PLAY ANOTHER ROUND</span><i>✳</i></div></div>
<section class="section"><div class="container">
 <div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">PICK YOUR NEXT DISTRACTION</span><h2>There's a bit<br/>of everything.</h2></div><p>Some things help your server run. Some give people a reason to stick around for five more minutes. NightGuildBot makes room for both.</p></div>
 <div class="feature-grid">{features.map(([icon,title,desc,href],i)=><a class="feature-card" href={href}><div class="feature-card-top"><div class="feature-icon">{icon}</div><span class="feature-number">0{i+1}</span></div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{desc}</p><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</div>
</div></section>
<section class="section closing-section"><div class="container callout-banner"><div><span class="eyebrow">NO BIG SPEECH. JUST GET IN THERE.</span><h2>Have a look around.</h2><p>The docs will get you started. The rest is best explored in your server.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="docs/index.html">Open the docs <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="callout-stamp" aria-hidden="true">NG<br/>✳</span></div></section>
</SiteLayout>